# The Vault enters tapped; choosing to keep it tapped adds one counter on each upkeep, then it untaps and spends two of three for {B}{B} (CR 502.3, 603.4).
[Bot1 Deck]
Bottomless Vault
Island x25
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x25
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Bottomless Vault.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Tapped = true
Bot1.Decline
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Counters.Storage = 1
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Counters.Storage = 2
Bot1.Decline
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Counters.Storage = 3
Bot1.Accept
[T9 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Counters.Storage = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Activate(X: 2)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Activate(X: 4)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{B}
? Bot1.ManaFrom = {B}{B} Bottomless Vault
? Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Counters.Storage = 1
! Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Activate
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Bottomless Vault.Counters.Storage = 1
